   "rule_summary": "Manufacturers shall report every thermal incident involving overheating, fire, or thermal runaway to the relevant regulator within 5 business days of becoming aware of it, including incidents initially reported by customers or installers. A death, serious injury, evacuation, or spread of fire beyond the battery shall be reported within 24 hours.",
